{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>目前，27GB只能視為密鑰卡標示的基礎容量。現有信息並未説明這一數字是否包含首日更新、額外語言包或後續內容，正式安裝需求仍需以任天堂商店及產品最終頁面為準。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"日版密鑰卡顯示《塞爾達傳説：時之笛 重製版》Switch 2版容量為27GB\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261020/1792487927_440986_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>《塞爾達傳説：時之笛 重製版》計劃於2026年11月5日推出，時間處於《塞爾達傳説》系列40周年階段。配套主題主機和Pro控制器預計於10月29日先行上市，另有兩款新amiibo安排在2027年推出。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"日版密鑰卡顯示《塞爾達傳説：時之笛 重製版》Switch 2版容量為27GB\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261020/1792487922_832772.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"日版密鑰卡顯示《塞爾達傳説：時之笛 重製版》Switch 2版容量為27GB\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261020/1792487927_440986_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:03.805422+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:02:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T23:58:16.751110+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:49.761845+00:00","content_hash":"f84b51b2c230971f7f3132a2bcfe34a5a31490ac82ff3726624a45f025de58a8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}